    quarto,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Ruby (>= 3.0), jekyll, bundler
URL: https://github.com/allanvc/jekylldown
